==Description==
'''Snowballer Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 6 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bell|150}} or {{Robux|42}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|520}} or {{Robux|324}}.

==Appearance==
'''Snowballer Charm''' appearance is based on the default [[Snowballer]], one of the event towers from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. The charm has it firing its snowball canon while standing on a rock. When placed down, it plays a sound of a crystallic object behind dropped down.

The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. It does not change colors.

